    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051103.0312\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 4 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua International News Advisory -- Nov. 4\n\n\n\n\nFollowing are some of the major international news stories scheduled to be covered or pursued by Xinhua on Friday.\n\n-- EU ignorant of CIA secret prisons: EU commissioner.\n\n-- Peruvian congress approves bill on maritime territory.\n\n-- Arms seized in outskirts of Mar del Plata ahead of the 4th Summit of the Americas.",
